{"server":"tw","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_02_end","groupId":"act44side","stageId":"act44side_02","title":"靈異特輯","storyCode":"AT-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"2bad780729bc2c3ff44e0b3174dcd017184da4c8025a5d46c7058c8842b25285","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"半夜，疲憊的星熊遇見了怪談中的“輪入道”。追蹤“輪入道”的過程中，她結識了關東煮攤老闆森內。而萌萌香家的電視突然播放起助理澪小姐被人要求謀害自己的畫面，更恐怖的是，沒過多久，澪真的出現在了萌萌香家的門口。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰？誰在這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車鈴聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揉眼睛）這是夢？我還沒睡醒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"明亮的月光下，雜物早已被收拾乾淨的地上，分明停著一輛小小的獨輪車。\n它就這麼立在地上，沒有依靠任何東西，甚至都沒處在平衡狀態，是往一邊歪著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼搞的……我喝多了？才半瓶米酒，怎麼可能？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"更詭異的是，假如真有什麼看不見的東西騎在獨輪車上，那麼，這個東西頭上還戴著一頂比例完全合適的、小小的獨輪車安全帽。\n但沒有人知道獨輪車上面到底有沒有“什麼”，所以，在星熊看來，那頂安全帽毫無疑問，正浮在半空中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警察的竊聽裝置？金兵衛的把戲？鐵齋叔？某種源石技藝？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g5_kajistreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的記者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很多觀眾都認為青鬼的怪談與輪入道的怪談有關！許多青鬼的受害者都是在目睹輪入道之後遭遇不測，我想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……輪入道？怪談是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總之先拿起來看看吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"和星熊彎腰同時，獨輪車的踏板飛轉起來，整輛車連同安全帽咻的一聲竄了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——站住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g18_kajistreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"獨輪車在前面飛馳，星熊跟在後面窮追不捨。\n她清清楚楚地看見，踏板帶動車輪，上面的小安全帽有規律地一上一下……\n怎麼看都像是有個看不見的東西在騎車。轉彎時獨輪車的踏板在地上摩擦了一下，甚至還濺起幾星火花。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香整個身子一軟，倒在榻榻米上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……根本睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然明天早上去一趟事務所吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先好好認個錯，態度誠懇一點……實在不行就再多接一點工作，澪小姐會原諒我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是鐘聲啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是開著燈和電視睡吧……"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香慢慢爬到電視前，按下開關。\n吵鬧、誇張、做作，然而就像御機本身一樣令人安心的廣告聲響了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚就先……睡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……安心與安定的，御機聯合人壽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（音樂聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位觀眾大家好，歡迎收看金石台的午夜新聞，現在是凌晨一點三十分……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快到丑時三刻了……幽靈最活躍的時間段……嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……與北院聯合制定的計劃受阻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……暴雨襲擊諫崎城，農業地塊受災情況可控……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……接下來讓我們關注受人矚目的御機娛樂產業……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（刺耳的警報聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼了？出什麼事了？地震？天災？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（訊號干擾聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——急通知，緊急通知。這不是演習，這不是演習。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……目前正遭到北院軍隊的全面攻擊——遭到北院軍隊的全面攻擊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了您的人身安全，請遵守以下指示——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（刺耳的不明聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北院軍隊？怎麼可能？！到底發生了什麼事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（訊號干擾聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香！萌萌香！萌萌香！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，這不是……我的現場直播錄影嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正因大家都獨自一人與世浮沉♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"些許易逝的溫柔才更讓人不忍♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我永遠注視你的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（卡頓聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"注視你的、注視你的、注視你的、注視你的、注視你的、注視你的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——以下指示：請身處室內的居民立刻關閉門窗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"注視你的、"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"注視你的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香猛地一聲從榻榻米上跳起來。電視裡出現的東西實在過於異常，她把手裡的東西胡亂朝電視丟去。\n緊接著，明明沒有轉台，裡面的節目卻又開始換來換去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……最後的最後，歡迎大家光臨仁田街上的“深夜心動雲獸屋”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三船~♪信用金庫~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電視裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三……三……信……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老闆……請再給她一次機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音是……？"},{"type":"narration","text":"熟悉的女聲從電視裡傳出，萌萌香心中的恐懼慢慢減弱，她把頭從巨大的枕頭後探出一些，嘗試看清螢幕裡的畫面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g6_gokudouoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"有點熟悉的男聲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是關鍵時刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"非常熟悉的女聲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。但……我們現在沒有她與鐵齋私下來往的證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐？還有集團總裁三船先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"電視裡到底在放什麼？錄影？直播？"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香揉了揉眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪，她已經不受控了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕不是受鐵齋指使，這種事有一次就會有第二次。所以，像你之前做的一樣，讓她直接悄無聲息地消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生，現在這個時間，不適合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在幫她求情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她現在突然消失，我們勢必要花更多的精力去控制輿論。我怕這會影響到您接下來的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼，你說什麼話都是這副表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你動了惻隱之心，那好，隨便找個理由，跟她解約，逼她隱退……對了，幫她染上個礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生，這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩條路，你自己挑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，滿屋的垃圾，她偏偏撿起了那把斷刀，當時我們怎麼找都找不到，只能草草偽造了一把的斷刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算她是無心的，事情的性質也已經變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……礦石病？三船先生……吩咐澪小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓誰得礦石病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有斷刀……我在滿屋的垃圾裡撿起來的是斷刀？"},{"type":"narration","text":"從“兇宅”的樓上掉下去以後，她草草換了套衣服，把髒衣服包成一團，就離開了節目現場。\n那根“棍子”八成是被她順手和髒衣服包在一起了。\n萌萌香起身走到門口，果然把那根“棍子”從髒衣服中翻了出來。\n的確是一把斷掉的真刀。\n“事情的性質已經變了”？就因為這把刀？\n她很想立刻把刀丟出窗外，丟得越遠越好，但理智告訴她，這麼做只會惹出更大的麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是帶著吧。如果、如果有人要的話，我還能還回去，或者，至少……"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知是因為從兇宅裡撿了把刀的這個事實，還是因為電視裡三船說話的口氣，一陣惡寒順著她的脊椎一直爬到頭頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她把檯燈開了又關，關了又開。\n檯燈亮起，她怕屋外的人看到窗上的剪影。\n檯燈熄滅，她又怕黑暗中突然出現闖入者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在商量怎麼處理我嗎？就因為我發了那篇貼文？就因為我撿了把斷刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消失……礦石病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能的，一定是搞錯了。他們都沒有提到我的名字——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"樓下忽然傳來腳步聲。很熟悉，很穩，很快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香已經被各種事逼到了崩潰邊緣。她能猜到來者是誰，但腳步聲每響一次，她就後退一點……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一直到退無可退的窗邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……萌萌香？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你睡了，所以就直接開門進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你之前都會先敲三下門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們要處置的不是我，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"處置？萌萌香，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接殺掉，或者染上礦石病……你們說的不是我，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐，剛才不知道為什麼，我的電視突然開始播放……你和三船先生商量要……處理掉某個人的影片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先前只知道我們事務所屬於金石集團，金石集團和金石會有資金上的關係，我以為就只有這種程度，我沒想到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們說的人不是我，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，你先跟我走。這件事還有餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們說的……真的是我？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i16"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我要收拾東西。我要收拾很長很長時間，我要關門了，你在外面等我好嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘴上說著關門，但萌萌香一步也不敢往前走。\n而門口的澪也一直站在原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不用，不用你幫，我自己收拾就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐，請你不要……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我會幫你的，萌萌香。"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是面無表情地將一句話重複了三遍，曾經熟悉的身影就在一瞬間變得無比可怕。\n幾次呼吸過後，就連萌萌香自己也沒有想到，她下一步的動作……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是拉開窗戶，從二樓跳了下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，老闆，剛剛有一輛獨輪車繞過你的攤位過去了，請問你有看到它往哪個方向離開了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攤位老闆","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獨輪車？哪有什麼獨輪車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攤位老闆","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說前面就是仁田街，現在那裡密密麻麻全都是尋歡作樂的人，怎麼可能有人往那邊騎車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是一般的獨輪車，是一台小的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攤位老闆","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小的？多小？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很小，騎得很快，半空中還懸著一頂配套的安全帽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這是……昨天晚上那個關東煮攤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"攤位老闆","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自我介紹一下，我姓森內，森內徹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定自己在追一輛有安全帽懸在空中的獨輪車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不是什麼好東西哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你追逐的獨輪車，在怪談中被稱為“輪入道”，和“兇宅中的青鬼”差不多是相伴相生的，也有人認為根本就是同一個東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對怪談很熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我自誇，這條街上，恐怕沒有人比我更熟悉與怪談相關的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了找一個……人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願你找的不是什麼二十年前的青鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，怎麼會呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要找的，是“神明大人”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
